### JoinQueue
POST {{base}}/api/matches/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"diff":  "EXPERT"}

### JoinQueue2
POST {{base}}/api/matches/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTwo}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "diff": "EXPERT"
}

### QueueStatus
GET {{base}}/api/matches/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### CancelMatchmaking
DELETE {{base}}/api/matches/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTwo}}

### getStateFirst
GET {{base}}/api/matches/{{matchID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### getStateSecond
GET {{base}}/api/matches/{{matchID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTwo}}

### reveal
POST {{base}}/api/matches/{{matchID}}/reveal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"row": 2, "col": 2}

### flag
POST {{base}}/api/matches/{{matchID}}/flag
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"row": 0, "col": 1}

### forfeit
POST {{base}}/api/matches/{{matchID}}/forfeit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

